              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "All classes at the Stadium Road and Karimabad campuses in Karachi have been suspended and student hostels will be closed in the coming days. The decision follows advice by the federal government to temporarily halt academic activities at all universities and degree-awarding institutions in Pakistan, including AKU. All other business activities at the University and its teaching hospital in Karachi are to proceed as normal.",
